title: RedLizardFriend
---
Mitchell: Red Lizard Friend
Red Lizard Friend: Mitchell
Mitchell: Red Lizard Friend?
Red Lizard Friend: Mitchell?

-> Awkward family question
    Mitchell: So I heard your dad was a jerk
    Red Lizard Friend: yep, huge jerk
-> Awkward species question
    Mitchell: So I heard your species is dying
    Red Lizard Friend: yep, we'll all be dead soon
    Red Lizard Friend: unless someone were able to cure the disease in a sequel
-> Awkward mercenary question
    Mitchell: So I heard you've killed lots
    Red Lizard Friend: yep
    Red Lizard Friend: oh so many

Mitchell: I should go
===

title: MilitaristicBirdCop
---
Mitchell: Hello Militaristic Bird Cop
Militaristic Bird Cop: Hi Mitchell

-> investigate #lm
    -> Your people are militaristic #lt
        Militaristic Bird Cop: Yes, we are
        Militaristic Bird Cop: We have the most ships
        Militaristic Bird Cop: Which may or may not be relevant in future games
    -> You were a cop? #lm
        Militaristic Bird Cop: Yes
        Militaristic Bird Cop: Although arguably a bad one
    -> Women are into you? #lb
        Militaristic Bird Cop: Terrifyingly so
        Mitchell: why?
        Militaristic Bird Cop: I think it's the hips
    -> I should go #rm
-> I should go #rm

Mitchell: I should go
